        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 3:40PM AKDT until September 26 at 6:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 25 to 35 kt with gusts up to 40 kt and
seas 8 to 13 ft expected.

* WHERE...Cape Fairweather to Icy Cape out to 15 NM, Cape
Spencer to Cape Fairweather from 15 to 85 NM and Cape
Fairweather to Icy Cape from 15 to 80 NM.

* WHEN...From 10 PM this evening to 6 PM AKDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
